    "vs": {
      "x": 4230,
      "y": 11224,
      "w": 340,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Decided 2026-09-17: fully hidden draft (same eight rows, no reveal until Deploy), strictly live with timers (general 45s, row 40s, line 90s; the game picks at zero), and the battle watched separately with a presence line. One battle, ground drawn by the room. A rematch keeps the room."
    },
    "entry": {
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 340,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Entry to 1v1: a third tab, VERSUS, in the bottom nav on every top-level screen. Today carries a Join row only while a friend is waiting in a room (rust dot on the tab, words on the page). An invite link opens the room directly and skips all of this."
    }
